diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..75dcea5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+# Quizzy
+
+Live quizzes for conference talks. Moderators prepare quizzes and run them on a big screen; the audience joins from their phones.
+
+## Run
+
+From the project root, with `RAILS_ENV=production`:
+
+```
+QUIZZY_MODERATOR_USERNAME=moderator \
+QUIZZY_MODERATOR_PASSWORD=secret \
+SECRET_KEY_BASE=$(bin/rails secret) \
+PORT=3000 \
+bin/serve
+```
+
+`bin/serve` prepares the SQLite database under `storage/`, precompiles assets, and listens on all IPv4 interfaces. The app is plain HTTP and accepts any host. `GET /up` is the health check.
+
+Moderator pages live under `/moderate` and require HTTP Basic authentication with the credentials above.
